# Argus prompt templates. Empty, and intended to stay that way.
#
# Argus consults no model. Detection is statistical - a peer-relative baseline
# with a declared floor, see agents/anomaly/ - and deciding which anomaly is the
# cause is Zeus's and Delphi's work rather than this agent's.
#
# The directory exists because tests/unit/test_repo_structure.py requires every
# agent to ship one. The TODO that was here said "populate this directory", and
# a TODO that must never be actioned trains people to ignore TODOs.
#
# Phase: 1 - Contracts & First Agent Path
